{"2926670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World Wonders: Hidden Histories", "steam_appid": 2926670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysteries of history in &quot;World Wonders: Hidden Secrets&quot;, a captivating hidden object game. Journey to awe-inspiring locales like Egypt's pyramids and Cambodia's ancient temples. Each level unfolding a new historical era. This game skillfully blends traditional hidden object puzzles with a variety of other challenges, offering a rich, immersive experience. Earn coins to collect and display historical artifacts, and unlock Codex entries for deeper insights into each civilization's history and culture. &quot;World Wonders: Hidden Secrets&quot; is a unique blend of entertainment and education, perfect for those who love puzzles and the mysteries of our past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect priceless artifacts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover history and culture!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit ancient places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind hidden items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore photos of important places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the differences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore broken artifacts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colour the pictures!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysteries of history in &quot;World Wonders: Hidden Secrets&quot;, a captivating hidden object game. Journey to awe-inspiring locales like Egypt's pyramids and Cambodia's ancient temples. Each level unfolding a new historical era. This game skillfully blends traditional hidden object puzzles with a variety of other challenges, offering a rich, immersive experience. Earn coins to collect and display historical artifacts, and unlock Codex entries for deeper insights into each civilization's history and culture. &quot;World Wonders: Hidden Secrets&quot; is a unique blend of entertainment and education, perfect for those who love puzzles and the mysteries of our past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect priceless artifacts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover history and culture!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit ancient places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind hidden items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore photos of important places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the differences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore broken artifacts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colour the pictures!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Dive into 'World Wonders: Hidden Secrets,' a puzzle adventure through history's greatest civilizations with engaging hidden object challenges.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Russian, Dutch", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926670/bba22abc2c9d2a0b459e9d25cf9c45ca4a2f29e6/header.jpg?t=1753989839", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926670/1bb6cf5b334f5c0f083fed906a73912416a218c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753989839", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926670/1bb6cf5b334f5c0f083fed906a73912416a218c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753989839", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\